    {
      "id": "airs_tsurf",
      "name_zh": "地表氣溫（AIRS）",
      "name_en": "Surface air temperature (AIRS)",
      "definition_zh": "衛星上的紅外線儀器量到的近地面空氣溫度，單位是絕對溫度 K；這裡是白天約下午一點半衛星經過時的值。",
      "category": "能量",
      "source": "giovanni",
      "source_variable_id": "AIRS3STM_7_0_SurfAirTemp_A",
      "product_version": "7.0",
      "native_temporal_res": "month",
      "is_nasa": true,
      "note_zh": "升軌（_A，當地約 13:30 過境），會比全日平均的氣溫（GLDAS、MERRA-2）偏高，不能直接比絕對值。 區域平均沒有 north：這個產品是 1° 網格，north 的範圍（緯度 24.6–25.4）裡沒有格點中心。",
      "harmony_collection": "C1701805662-GES_DISC",
      "harmony_skip_regions": [
        "north"
      ],
      "doi": "10.5067/UBENJB9D3T2H",
      "product": "AIRS3STM.7.0",
      "source_long_name": "Air temperature at surface (Daytime/Ascending, AIRS-only)",
      "unit": "K",
      "valid_from": "2002-09-01",
      "valid_to": "2026-10-01"
    },
    {
      "id": "airs_h2ovap",
      "name_zh": "大氣總水氣",
      "name_en": "Total column water vapor (AIRS)",
      "definition_zh": "從地面到大氣層頂一整柱空氣裡的水氣，如果全部凝結成水，每平方公尺有幾公斤。",
      "category": "水（氣態）",
      "source": "giovanni",
      "source_variable_id": "AIRS3STM_7_0_TotH2OVap_A",
      "product_version": "7.0",
      "native_temporal_res": "month",
      "is_nasa": true,
      "note_zh": "升軌（_A，當地約 13:30 過境）的觀測。 區域平均沒有 north：這個產品是 1° 網格，north 的範圍（緯度 24.6–25.4）裡沒有格點中心。",
      "harmony_collection": "C1701805662-GES_DISC",
      "harmony_skip_regions": [
        "north"
      ],
      "doi": "10.5067/UBENJB9D3T2H",
      "product": "AIRS3STM.7.0",
